      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 255265,
            "end": 300848,
            "text": "Let's start wherever is most useful for you."
          },
          {
            "start": 300849,
            "end": 319081,
            "text": "Happy to go through whatever is on your list today."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 337314,
            "end": 401131,
            "text": "It has been a fairly normal month for us, a couple of things came up though."
          },
          {
            "start": 401132,
            "end": 437597,
            "text": "We wanted to make sure we covered a couple of open items today."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 446714,
            "end": 474064,
            "text": "Let's get into it, what would you like to start with?"
          },
          {
            "start": 474065,
            "end": 556113,
            "text": "Let me know which item you would like to prioritize first."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 565230,
            "end": 647279,
            "text": "When someone changes roles in our identity provider the sync misses it, and they keep the old permission set until someone catches it manually."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 665512,
            "end": 683746,
            "text": "Two staff members changed departments back in August and still had their old access as of last week when someone noticed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 711095,
            "end": 765795,
            "text": "Thanks for explaining that, I want to get one more detail."
          },
          {
            "start": 765796,
            "end": 811378,
            "text": "How long did it take before anyone noticed the access had not updated?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-01",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 820495,
            "end": 875194,
            "text": "It was almost three weeks before someone flagged it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 902544,
            "end": 975477,
            "text": "Before we close out, anything else worth flagging while we have time?"
